# PUBLIC REPOSITORY. Everything committed here is public, including its history.
# Instructor material lives in the private repository, assessment items on the LMS.
# These rules are a second line of defence, not the first.

# Instructor and assessment material: never here
lecturer-only/
lecturer/
instructor/
private/
# (specific names only: a broad pattern such as *marking* would silently drop a demo like s04-d2-watermarking.html)
*answer-key*
*ground-truth*
*marking-scheme*
*marking-rubric*
*model-answers*
*phase-test-paper*
*viva-probes*

# Evidence and binaries: the portal hosts teaching, never evidence (lab share / LMS)
*.E01
*.e01
*.Ex01
*.dd
*.raw
*.img
*.mem
*.vmem
*.dmp
*.aff
*.aff4
*.ad1
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.plaso
*.ova
*.vmdk
*.vdi
*.qcow2
*.exe
*.dll
*.bin
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.gz

# Documents that should not be published here (textbooks, scanned handouts)
*.pdf

# Local build and OS files
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.jekyll-metadata
.sass-cache/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
